  "question": {
    "text": "Two dices are rolled. If both dices have six faces numbered <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the probability that the sum of the numbers on the top faces is less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math> is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math>",
